Bloodlust Crit Loop
    Events
        Time - Every 1.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in BL_CritGroup and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Set VariableSet Temp_Integer = (Custom value of (Picked unit))
                -------- ======================================== --------
                -------- If the unit no longer has Bloodlust at the stored level, remove the stored Crit bonus --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        ((Picked unit) has buff Bloodlust (Level 3)) Equal to False
                        ((Picked unit) has buff Bloodlust (Level 4)) Equal to False
                        ((Picked unit) has buff Bloodlust (Level 5)) Equal to False
                    Then - Actions
                        Set VariableSet Stats_Crit[Temp_Integer] = (Stats_Crit[Temp_Integer] - BL_Crit[Temp_Integer])
                        Set VariableSet BL_AppliedLevel[Temp_Integer] = 0
                        Set VariableSet BL_Crit[Temp_Integer] = 0
                        Unit Group - Remove (Picked unit) from BL_CritGroup.
                    Else - Actions
        -------- ======================================== --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Number of units in BL_CritGroup) Equal to 0
            Then - Actions
                Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
            Else - Actions
